  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Concerted Action to Protect and Strengthen the Resilience of   Human Rights Defenders and Organisations at Risk in Tunisia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The beneficiaries of this action are human rights defenders, pro-democracy activists and CSOs at risk, needing urgent and sustainable support to continue their work, as described in the UN Declaration on Human Rights Defenders (HRDs) and the EU Guidelines on HRDs. The objective of the action is to provide a coordinated mechanism to better protect HRDs, pro-democracy activists and CSOs against physical and online threats, and to support them by providing direct assistance in case of threatened or actual persecution. To achieve this objective, activities will be implemented along three main axes: (1) support to CSOs, (2) protection of HRDs &amp; (3) developing resilience strategies.</narrative>
  </description>
